{"product_id":"nasty-bolt-50k-vape","title":"Nasty BOLT 50k Vape (50000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe NASTY BOLT Hyper Puff Vape Device is built for those who crave power, consistency, and flavour that hits hard. It offers three performance modes—ECO, NORMAL, and TURBO— so you can tailor every puff to your vibe. Expect up to 5 days of use on a single charge, and when it’s time to recharge, the fast-charging tech gets you back in action within minutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnder the hood, the dual mesh coil system delivers next-level heating precision and massive vapour production. Every draw is smooth, flavour-packed, and satisfying—exactly how a premium vape should feel. With smart power management ensuring stable output, the NASTY BOLT stands out as the ultimate choice for vapers who demand long-lasting performance, bold taste, and zero compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume: 26ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 1000mAH\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuff: 50,000\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine: 50mg\/mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAir Flow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtra Fast - Charging Rechargeable Battery (\u0026lt; 25 mins)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Screen With Flavour \u0026amp; Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Modes Selection\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEco\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNormal\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurbo\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":41973940092983,"sku":"N BOLT 50K V (50K P) - Grape Ice","price":2600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Berry Grape","offer_id":41973947301943,"sku":"N BOLT 50K V (50K P) - Berry Grape","price":2600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Energy Drink","offer_id":41973947400247,"sku":"N BOLT 50K V (50K P) - Energy Drink","pric